r_29.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蒜 營養素\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/624c2c3a8834a7dacfea0dd4a88f18aa/2022-10/cancer_30.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蒜 防胃癌作用\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d47b8fda0ac9703aefef2e2c8a5f707/2022-10/cancer_31.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蒜 建議吃法\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c39d0585813a8d75203f7838b55b4d4/2022-10/cancer_32.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"魚類 防癌功效\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7193b2d069d7b85ce0879daa4b654b7c/2022-10/cancer_33.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"魚類 防腸癌作用\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4b6efc794a5cd9e82a8dd29d381e160/2022-10/cancer_34.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"魚類 建議吃法\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d5135e069b3f5b1e44baf0a7f54a9ca/2022-10/cancer_35.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-22T08:06:58.125719+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1414,"images":38,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}